      "text": {
        "jp": "正直、飛空艇団再建は簡単ではない。\r\nだが、優秀な者が揃っているからな。\r\n必ず成し遂げてみせる。",
        "official_en": "I’ll be honest, rebuilding the airship squadron is no walk in the park... But we have the realm’s best people with us. I’ll get it done.",
        "real_en": "To be honest, rebuilding the airship squadron isn't easy. But we've got talented people, so we'll see it through."
